-- חוזר לבעלויות תשע"ב/13: קצובת ביגוד לשנת הלימודים תשע"ב (15.7.2012)
-- The clothing allowance for school year 2011/12 (09/11-08/12): the general
-- allowance at level 4 (2,076 ₪), pro-rated by position and capped at one
-- position, the multi-employer rule and the 140% limit; the extra allowance
-- for physical-education teachers by employment rate; and the allowance in
-- technological education, by the subject taught (two lists).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT property_checks
IMPORT `clothing-recuperation-circulars-2-common`

-- not weighed against `the Hours of Work and Rest Law`: the clothing
-- allowance is paid pro rata to the position, up to one full position, and
-- the cap of 140% of a position across all employers restates the
-- agreements' limit on employment beyond a full position. A cap takes away
-- no rest and adds no hour; the weeks the agreements allow beyond a full
-- position are weighed where they set them (the takanon's §1.24, the base
-- agreement's §33, the Oz agreement's §14).

§ `תשע"ב/13 קצובת ביגוד לשנת הלימודים תשע"ב`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, title, date (15.7.2012), addressee, greeting, subject line and the lead-in ("by the Treasury's instructions on the clothing allowance, act as below"); no rule of its own.

-- Time is counted in school months of 2011/12 (common.l4: September 2011 =
-- 1, July 2012 = 11).

@desc The subjects of technological education the circular lists in section ג.1(א) and (ב).
DECLARE `technology subject` IS ONE OF
    `aviation systems in circular תשע"ב/13`
    `mechatronics in circular תשע"ב/13`
    `technical marine thermodynamics in circular תשע"ב/13`
    `CAD and CAM systems in circular תשע"ב/13`
    `maintenance of mechanical systems in circular תשע"ב/13`
    `automotive mechanics systems in circular תשע"ב/13`
    `computerised automotive systems in circular תשע"ב/13`
    `power, command and control systems in circular תשע"ב/13`
    `climate-control systems in circular תשע"ב/13`
    `the art of hotel cooking and baking`
    `seamanship - ships in circular תשע"ב/13`
    `television and film systems in circular תשע"ב/13`
    `photography systems in circular תשע"ב/13`
    `electronic systems in circular תשע"ב/13`
    `computing and control systems in circular תשע"ב/13`
    `computer systems in circular תשע"ב/13`
    `systems design and programming in circular תשע"ב/13`
    `biotechnology systems in circular תשע"ב/13`
    `tourism management in circular תשע"ב/13`
    `hotel management in circular תשע"ב/13`
    `early-childhood education in circular תשע"ב/13`
    `design in circular תשע"ב/13`
    `fashion and costume in circular תשע"ב/13`
    `hair design and beauty care in circular תשע"ב/13`
    `nursing in circular תשע"ב/13`
    `applied art in circular תשע"ב/13`
    `a subject on neither list`

@desc A teaching employee's school year 2011/12 at one employer, as far as this circular asks about it.
DECLARE `clothing year at an employer` HAS
    `in the teaching-staff grade`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `position at this employer`          IS A NUMBER @desc the share of a full position held at this employer (1 = 100%)
    `position at all employers`          IS A NUMBER @desc the share of a full position held at all employers together
    `entitled to the extra PE allowance` IS A BOOLEAN @desc a physical-education teacher entitled to the extra allowance under the existing rules (circular תשע"ב/8)
    `PE employment rate`                 IS A NUMBER @desc the employment rate the PE table is read by
    `in technological education`         IS A BOOLEAN @desc a teaching employee in technological education or a vocational instructor
    `subjects taught`                    IS A LIST OF `technology subject`

DECLARE `tashab-13 clothing action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the clothing allowance in circular תשע"ב/13` HAS `clothing paid` IS A NUMBER
    `pay the additional clothing allowances in circular תשע"ב/13` HAS `amount of the additional allowances paid` IS A NUMBER
    `work beyond 140% of a position in circular תשע"ב/13`

@desc The things section ג.1 grants in kind.
DECLARE `clothing item of circular תשע"ב/13` IS ONE OF
    `a pair of shoes in circular תשע"ב/13`
    `a coat`

§§ `א קצובת ביגוד – כללי`

-- א.1: the allowance is paid in full with the July 2012 salary. It sits
-- under "כללי", the general heading, and sections ב and ג name no other
-- date (F-2011-12_tashab_13-d). The reading adopted, by convention
-- dates.no-deadline (conventions.toml): July binds the general allowance of
-- section א; the additional allowances of sections ב and ג are owed with no
-- deadline, since no stated time is no deadline.
@ref akn:art_a__para_1
GIVEN e IS A `clothing year at an employer`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `tashab-13 clothing action`
DECIDE `paying the allowance with July's salary` e IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the clothing allowance in circular תשע"ב/13` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST `the general clothing allowance of circular תשע"ב/13` e
    WITHIN `month number` July
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "section א.1: the clothing allowance is paid in full with the July 2012 salary"

@ref akn:art_b/p1 akn:art_c__para_3
GIVEN e IS A `clothing year at an employer`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `tashab-13 clothing action`
DECIDE `paying the additional allowances of circular תשע"ב/13` e IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the additional clothing allowances in circular תשע"ב/13` `additional amount`
          PROVIDED `additional amount` AT LEAST `the extra PE clothing allowance` e PLUS `the technology clothing allowance` e
    LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "sections ב and ג name no month: the additional allowances are owed with no deadline"

#ASSERT `sections ב and ג name no month of payment`

-- א.2: an employee in the teaching-staff grade is entitled to a clothing
-- allowance as is customary for civil servants who receive the public, for
-- school year 2011/12 (09/11-08/12).
@ref akn:art_a__para_2
GIVEN e IS A `clothing year at an employer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the clothing allowance in circular תשע"ב/13` e IF
    e's `in the teaching-staff grade`

-- א.3: every teaching employee is paid at level 4, that is 2,076 ₪.
@ref akn:art_a__para_3
`the level-4 clothing allowance of circular תשע"ב/13` MEANS 2076

-- א.4: pro-rated to the position, and for no more than one full position
-- (100%). א.5: a teaching employee at more than one employer, with a total
-- position above 100% at both, takes at each employer separately the
-- allowance proportional to the position held there.
-- F-2011-12_tashab_13-b: the two sentences give a teacher at two employers
-- different totals. The reading adopted: א.5 is the rule for several
-- employers, and א.4's cap is read per employer.
@ref akn:art_a__para_4 akn:art_a__para_5
GIVEN e IS A `clothing year at an employer`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the clothing share at this employer` e IS
    min (e's `position at this employer`) 1

GIVEN e IS A `clothing year at an employer`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the general clothing allowance of circular תשע"ב/13` e IS
    IF `entitled to the clothing allowance in circular תשע"ב/13` e
    THEN `the level-4 clothing allowance of circular תשע"ב/13` TIMES `the clothing share at this employer` e
    ELSE 0

-- א.6: a teaching employee may not work beyond 140% of a position at all
-- employers together; nothing above is a permission to employ beyond it.
-- The text sets no time limit.
@ref akn:art_a__para_6
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `tashab-13 clothing action`
DECIDE `the 140% limit of circular תשע"ב/13` IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    SHANT `work beyond 140% of a position in circular תשע"ב/13`
    LEST BREACH BY `the teaching employee` BECAUSE "section א.6: no teaching employee works beyond 140% of a position at all employers together"

`the position limit at all employers of circular תשע"ב/13` MEANS 1.4

GIVEN e IS A `clothing year at an employer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `within the 140% limit in circular תשע"ב/13` e IF
    e's `position at all employers` AT MOST `the position limit at all employers of circular תשע"ב/13`

§§ `ב קצובת ביגוד נוספת למורה לחינוך גופני`

-- Section ב: following circular תשע"ב/8, from 2010/11, the extra
-- allowance for physical-education teachers by employment rate, "correct
-- for 1/9/11". The table as printed; its bounds meet at 0.3 and 0.5
-- (F-2011-12_tashab_13-a).
@ref akn:art_b/p1 akn:art_b/t1
DECLARE `PE row of circular תשע"ב/13` HAS
    `PE row from` IS A NUMBER
    `PE row to`   IS A NUMBER @desc 999 stands for "ומעלה"
    `PE row amount` IS A NUMBER

`the PE table for 2011/12` MEANS
    LIST `PE row of circular תשע"ב/13` 0   0.3 0,
         `PE row of circular תשע"ב/13` 0.3 0.5 663,
         `PE row of circular תשע"ב/13` 0.5 999 1322

-- The rows as printed, each bound inclusive, only to show where they meet
-- (thresholds.shared-bound): no operative rule reads this list; the rule
-- that answers gives a shared bound to the row that opens at it.
GIVEN r IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the amounts the PE table gives of circular תשע"ב/13 for` r IS
    map (GIVEN b YIELD b's `PE row amount`)
        (filter (GIVEN b YIELD r AT LEAST b's `PE row from` AND r AT MOST b's `PE row to`)
                `the PE table for 2011/12`)

-- F-2011-12_tashab_13-a: 0.3 is both "עד 0.3" and "מ-0.3", and 0.5 both
-- "עד 0.5" and "מ-0.5".
`the PE table gives 0.3 and 0.5 two amounts each in circular תשע"ב/13` MEANS
        `the amounts the PE table gives of circular תשע"ב/13 for` 0.3 EQUALS LIST 0, 663
    AND `the amounts the PE table gives of circular תשע"ב/13 for` 0.5 EQUALS LIST 663, 1322
#ASSERT `the PE table gives 0.3 and 0.5 two amounts each in circular תשע"ב/13`

-- Every other rate has exactly one row.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN r YIELD count (`the amounts the PE table gives of circular תשע"ב/13 for` r) EQUALS 1)
            (LIST 0, 0.1, 0.29, 0.31, 0.4, 0.49, 0.51, 0.75, 1, 1.25)

-- The reading adopted (F-2011-12_tashab_13-a): the row that opens at a bound
-- ("מ-") governs it.
GIVEN e IS A `clothing year at an employer`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the extra PE clothing allowance` e IS
    IF e's `entitled to the extra PE allowance`
    THEN BRANCH IF e's `PE employment rate` `has reached the row from` 0.5 THEN 1322
                IF e's `PE employment rate` `has reached the row from` 0.3 THEN 663
                OTHERWISE 0
    ELSE 0

-- F-2011-12_tashab_13-e: "שיעור העסקה" is not said to be the share of the
-- position in physical education or the employee's whole position. The
-- reading adopted, as F-2011-12_tashab_08-c and its siblings read the same
-- words: the share in physical education, taken as the input
-- `PE employment rate`.
`the two readings of the employment rate differ in circular תשע"ב/13` MEANS
    NOT (`the amounts the PE table gives of circular תשע"ב/13 for` 0.2
         EQUALS `the amounts the PE table gives of circular תשע"ב/13 for` 1)
#ASSERT `the two readings of the employment rate differ in circular תשע"ב/13`

#ASSERT all (GIVEN r YIELD elem (`the extra PE clothing allowance` (`clothing year at an employer` WITH `in the teaching-staff grade` IS TRUE, `position at this employer` IS 1, `position at all employers` IS 1, `entitled to the extra PE allowance` IS TRUE, `PE employment rate` IS r, `in technological education` IS FALSE, `subjects taught` IS EMPTY))
                                  (`the amounts the PE table gives of circular תשע"ב/13 for` r))
            (LIST 0, 0.1, 0.3, 0.4, 0.5, 0.75, 1)

§§ `ג קצובת ביגוד בחינוך הטכנולוגי`

-- akn:art_c__para_1 The number of section ג.1; its rules are (א) and (ב).

-- Section ג: a teaching employee in technological education or a vocational
-- instructor is paid a clothing allowance for 2011/12 by the subject lists.
-- F-2011-12_tashab_13-c: a teacher of subjects on both lists meets both
-- clauses; the text does not say whether the two entitlements add up. The
-- reading adopted: one allowance, the list-(א) one, whose pair of shoes and
-- two coats already includes the two coats of list (ב).
@ref akn:art_c/p1
GIVEN e IS A `clothing year at an employer`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the full-position technology allowance` e IS
    BRANCH IF `teaches a shoes-and-coats subject` e THEN `the value of a pair of shoes and two coats of circular תשע"ב/13`
           IF `teaches a two-coats subject` e THEN `the value of two coats of circular תשע"ב/13`
           OTHERWISE 0

GIVEN e IS A `clothing year at an employer`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the two entitlements added` e IS
    (IF `teaches a shoes-and-coats subject` e THEN `the value of a pair of shoes and two coats of circular תשע"ב/13` ELSE 0)
    PLUS (IF `teaches a two-coats subject` e THEN `the value of two coats of circular תשע"ב/13` ELSE 0)

-- ג.1(א): in one of these subjects, a pair of shoes and two coats a year,
-- worth 545 ₪.
@ref akn:art_c__para_1__subpara_a akn:art_c__para_1__subpara_a/p2 akn:art_c__para_1__subpara_a/t1
GIVEN e IS A `clothing year at an employer`
GIVETH A LIST OF `clothing item of circular תשע"ב/13`
DECIDE `the items ג.1(א) grants a year` e IS
    IF `teaches a shoes-and-coats subject` e
    THEN LIST `a pair of shoes in circular תשע"ב/13`, `a coat`, `a coat`
    ELSE EMPTY

GIVEN e IS A `clothing year at an employer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `teaches a shoes-and-coats subject` e IF
    e's `in technological education`
    AND any (GIVEN s YIELD elem s `the shoes-and-coats subjects of circular תשע"ב/13`) (e's `subjects taught`)

`the shoes-and-coats subjects of circular תשע"ב/13` MEANS
    LIST `aviation systems in circular תשע"ב/13`,
         `mechatronics in circular תשע"ב/13`,
         `technical marine thermodynamics in circular תשע"ב/13`,
         `CAD and CAM systems in circular תשע"ב/13`,
         `maintenance of mechanical systems in circular תשע"ב/13`,
         `automotive mechanics systems in circular תשע"ב/13`,
         `computerised automotive systems in circular תשע"ב/13`,
         `power, command and control systems in circular תשע"ב/13`,
         `climate-control systems in circular תשע"ב/13`,
         `the art of hotel cooking and baking`,
         `seamanship - ships in circular תשע"ב/13`,
         `television and film systems in circular תשע"ב/13`,
         `photography systems in circular תשע"ב/13`

`the value of a pair of shoes and two coats of circular תשע"ב/13` MEANS 545

-- ג.1(ב): in one of these subjects, two coats a year, worth 338 ₪.
@ref akn:art_c__para_1__subpara_b akn:art_c__para_1__subpara_b/p2 akn:art_c__para_1__subpara_b/t1
GIVEN e IS A `clothing year at an employer`
GIVETH A LIST OF `clothing item of circular תשע"ב/13`
DECIDE `the items ג.1(ב) grants a year` e IS
    IF `teaches a two-coats subject` e
    THEN LIST `a coat`, `a coat`
    ELSE EMPTY

GIVEN e IS A `clothing year at an employer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `teaches a two-coats subject` e IF
    e's `in technological education`
    AND any (GIVEN s YIELD elem s `the two-coats subjects of circular תשע"ב/13`) (e's `subjects taught`)

`the two-coats subjects of circular תשע"ב/13` MEANS
    LIST `electronic systems in circular תשע"ב/13`,
         `computing and control systems in circular תשע"ב/13`,
         `computer systems in circular תשע"ב/13`,
         `systems design and programming in circular תשע"ב/13`,
         `biotechnology systems in circular תשע"ב/13`,
         `tourism management in circular תשע"ב/13`,
         `hotel management in circular תשע"ב/13`,
         `early-childhood education in circular תשע"ב/13`,
         `design in circular תשע"ב/13`,
         `fashion and costume in circular תשע"ב/13`,
         `hair design and beauty care in circular תשע"ב/13`,
         `nursing in circular תשע"ב/13`,
         `applied art in circular תשע"ב/13`

`the value of two coats of circular תשע"ב/13` MEANS 338

-- The two lists share no subject.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN s YIELD NOT elem s `the two-coats subjects of circular תשע"ב/13`) `the shoes-and-coats subjects of circular תשע"ב/13`

-- ג.2: the technology allowance is in addition to the clothing allowance of
-- all teaching staff.
@ref akn:art_c__para_2
GIVEN e IS A `clothing year at an employer`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the general and technology clothing allowance` e IS
    `the general clothing allowance of circular תשע"ב/13` e
    PLUS `the technology clothing allowance` e

-- ג.3: it is pro-rated to the position, for no more than one full position.
@ref akn:art_c__para_3
GIVEN e IS A `clothing year at an employer`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the technology clothing allowance` e IS
    `the full-position technology allowance` e TIMES min (e's `position at this employer`) 1

-- akn:art_d The contact line for questions; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions The sign-off and signature; no rule.

§§ `The allowances one employer pays`

@export default The clothing allowances for school year 2011/12 one employer pays a teaching employee with the July 2012 salary under circular תשע"ב/13 — the general allowance, the extra physical-education allowance and the technological-education allowance
GIVEN e IS A `clothing year at an employer` @desc the employee's school year at this employer
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the clothing allowances` e IS
    `the general and technology clothing allowance` e
    PLUS `the extra PE clothing allowance` e

§§ `Worked examples`

`a full-position teacher` MEANS
    `clothing year at an employer` WITH
        `in the teaching-staff grade`        IS TRUE
        `position at this employer`          IS 1
        `position at all employers`          IS 1
        `entitled to the extra PE allowance` IS FALSE
        `PE employment rate`                 IS 0
        `in technological education`         IS FALSE
        `subjects taught`                    IS EMPTY

#ASSERT `the clothing allowances` `a full-position teacher` EQUALS 2076

`a PE teacher at 0.6 of a position` MEANS
    `clothing year at an employer` WITH
        `in the teaching-staff grade`        IS TRUE
        `position at this employer`          IS 0.6
        `position at all employers`          IS 0.6
        `entitled to the extra PE allowance` IS TRUE
        `PE employment rate`                 IS 0.6
        `in technological education`         IS FALSE
        `subjects taught`                    IS EMPTY

#ASSERT `the clothing allowances` `a PE teacher at 0.6 of a position` EQUALS 2567.6

`a mechatronics and electronics teacher at half a position` MEANS
    `clothing year at an employer` WITH
        `in the teaching-staff grade`        IS TRUE
        `position at this employer`          IS 0.5
        `position at all employers`          IS 0.5
        `entitled to the extra PE allowance` IS FALSE
        `PE employment rate`                 IS 0
        `in technological education`         IS TRUE
        `subjects taught`                    IS LIST `mechatronics in circular תשע"ב/13`, `electronic systems in circular תשע"ב/13`

-- F-2011-12_tashab_13-c: such a teacher meets both clauses, and the two
-- readings give 545 ₪ and 883 ₪ for a full position.
`a teacher of both lists is entitled under both clauses` MEANS
        `teaches a shoes-and-coats subject` `a mechatronics and electronics teacher at half a position`
    AND `teaches a two-coats subject` `a mechatronics and electronics teacher at half a position`
    AND NOT (`the two entitlements added` `a mechatronics and electronics teacher at half a position`
             EQUALS `the full-position technology allowance` `a mechatronics and electronics teacher at half a position`)
#ASSERT `a teacher of both lists is entitled under both clauses`

#ASSERT `the clothing allowances` `a mechatronics and electronics teacher at half a position` EQUALS 1310.5

-- F-2011-12_tashab_13-b: by א.5 a teacher at 0.8 with one employer and 0.6
-- with another is paid 0.8 and 0.6 of the allowance — 1.4 positions in all;
-- by א.4 no more than one full position.
`a teacher at 0.8 here` MEANS
    `clothing year at an employer` WITH
        `in the teaching-staff grade`        IS TRUE
        `position at this employer`          IS 0.8
        `position at all employers`          IS 1.4
        `entitled to the extra PE allowance` IS FALSE
        `PE employment rate`                 IS 0
        `in technological education`         IS FALSE
        `subjects taught`                    IS EMPTY

`the same teacher at 0.6 with the other employer` MEANS
    `clothing year at an employer` WITH
        `in the teaching-staff grade`        IS TRUE
        `position at this employer`          IS 0.6
        `position at all employers`          IS 1.4
        `entitled to the extra PE allowance` IS FALSE
        `PE employment rate`                 IS 0
        `in technological education`         IS FALSE
        `subjects taught`                    IS EMPTY

`the two employers together pay more than one full position's allowance` MEANS
    (`the clothing share at this employer` `a teacher at 0.8 here`
     PLUS `the clothing share at this employer` `the same teacher at 0.6 with the other employer`)
    GREATER THAN 1
#ASSERT `the two employers together pay more than one full position's allowance`
#ASSERT `within the 140% limit in circular תשע"ב/13` `a teacher at 0.8 here`

#TRACE `paying the allowance with July's salary` `a full-position teacher` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the clothing allowance in circular תשע"ב/13` 2076 AT 11
#TRACE `paying the allowance with July's salary` `a full-position teacher` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the clothing allowance in circular תשע"ב/13` 2076 AT 12
#TRACE `the 140% limit of circular תשע"ב/13` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the teaching employee` DOES `work beyond 140% of a position in circular תשע"ב/13` AT 3

-- F-2011-12_tashab_13-f: the table bands "שיעור העסקה" without saying whether a teacher
-- with more than one employer is banded per employer or across them; per
-- employer, two at 40% each pay more than one at 80%. The reading adopted,
-- as F-2021-22_tashpab_07-b's: each employer applies the table to the
-- position it employs.
`two employers at 40% each pay more than one employer at 80% in circular תשע"ב/13` MEANS
    sum (`the amounts the PE table gives of circular תשע"ב/13 for` 0.4) PLUS sum (`the amounts the PE table gives of circular תשע"ב/13 for` 0.4)
        GREATER THAN sum (`the amounts the PE table gives of circular תשע"ב/13 for` 0.8)
#ASSERT `two employers at 40% each pay more than one employer at 80% in circular תשע"ב/13`

§§ `Property checks`

-- The circular over its whole finite space: positions here and employment
-- rates in tenths from 0 to 1.5, every subject of either list, the subject
-- on neither, none, and one of each, entitled to the PE allowance or not,
-- in technological education or not, in the teaching-staff grade or not.

`every subject list checked of circular תשע"ב/13` MEANS
    EMPTY FOLLOWED BY (LIST `mechatronics in circular תשע"ב/13`, `electronic systems in circular תשע"ב/13`)
          FOLLOWED BY map (GIVEN t YIELD LIST t)
                          (append `the shoes-and-coats subjects of circular תשע"ב/13`
                                  (append `the two-coats subjects of circular תשע"ב/13` (LIST `a subject on neither list`)))

GIVEN g IS A BOOLEAN, f IS A NUMBER, p IS A BOOLEAN, r IS A NUMBER, k IS A BOOLEAN, l IS A LIST OF `technology subject`
GIVETH A `clothing year at an employer`
DECIDE `a checked year of circular תשע"ב/13` g f p r k l IS
    `clothing year at an employer` WITH
        `in the teaching-staff grade`        IS g
        `position at this employer`          IS f
        `position at all employers`          IS f
        `entitled to the extra PE allowance` IS p
        `PE employment rate`                 IS r
        `in technological education`         IS k
        `subjects taught`                    IS l

-- ב over employment rates in tenths: every one is in some row, two exactly
-- at 0.3 and 0.5 (F-2011-12_tashab_13-a, whole space), the amount is one
-- of those rows', it never falls, and it is nothing for a teacher not
-- entitled under circular תשע"ב/8. א.6: within the limit exactly up to 1.4.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN r YIELD
                LET rows MEANS `the amounts the PE table gives of circular תשע"ב/13 for` r
                    a MEANS `the extra PE clothing allowance` (`a checked year of circular תשע"ב/13` TRUE 1 TRUE r FALSE EMPTY)
                IN      count rows AT LEAST 1
                    AND (count rows EQUALS 2) EQUALS (r EQUALS 0.3 OR r EQUALS 0.5)
                    AND elem a rows
                    AND a AT MOST `the extra PE clothing allowance` (`a checked year of circular תשע"ב/13` TRUE 1 TRUE (r PLUS 0.1) FALSE EMPTY)
                    AND `the extra PE clothing allowance` (`a checked year of circular תשע"ב/13` TRUE 1 FALSE r FALSE EMPTY) EQUALS 0
                    AND (`within the 140% limit in circular תשע"ב/13` (`a checked year of circular תשע"ב/13` TRUE r FALSE 0 FALSE EMPTY)) EQUALS (r AT MOST 1.4))
            `tenths to 1.5`

-- ג: over every list checked, (א) grants a pair of shoes and two coats or
-- nothing, (ב) two coats or nothing, and where both grant, (א)'s coats are
-- as many as (ב)'s (the larger-grant reading of F-2011-12_tashab_13-c).
#ASSERT all (GIVEN l YIELD
                LET e MEANS `a checked year of circular תשע"ב/13` TRUE 1 FALSE 0 TRUE l
                    a MEANS `the items ג.1(א) grants a year` e
                    b MEANS `the items ג.1(ב) grants a year` e
                IN      (a EQUALS EMPTY OR a EQUALS LIST `a pair of shoes in circular תשע"ב/13`, `a coat`, `a coat`)
                    AND (b EQUALS EMPTY OR b EQUALS LIST `a coat`, `a coat`)
                    AND (a EQUALS EMPTY OR b EQUALS EMPTY
                         OR count (filter (GIVEN i YIELD i EQUALS `a coat`) a) EQUALS count b))
            `every subject list checked of circular תשע"ב/13`

-- א-ג over every grade, position, PE entitlement and subject list: the
-- whole one employer pays is never negative, something for anyone in the
-- grade with a position, nothing technological outside technological
-- education, never more than the three top amounts, never falling with a
-- larger position, above one paying as one.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN g YIELD
                all (GIVEN f YIELD
                        all (GIVEN p YIELD
                                all (GIVEN k YIELD
                                        all (GIVEN l YIELD
                                                LET e MEANS `a checked year of circular תשע"ב/13` g f p 0.6 k l
                                                    a MEANS `the clothing allowances` e
                                                IN      a AT LEAST 0
                                                    AND ((NOT g) OR f EQUALS 0 OR `the general clothing allowance of circular תשע"ב/13` e GREATER THAN 0)
                                                    AND (g OR `the general clothing allowance of circular תשע"ב/13` e EQUALS 0)
                                                    AND (k OR `the technology clothing allowance` e EQUALS 0)
                                                    AND a AT MOST `the level-4 clothing allowance of circular תשע"ב/13` PLUS 1322 PLUS `the value of a pair of shoes and two coats of circular תשע"ב/13`
                                                    AND a AT MOST `the clothing allowances` (`a checked year of circular תשע"ב/13` g (f PLUS 0.1) p 0.6 k l)
                                                    AND ((f LESS THAN 1) OR a EQUALS `the clothing allowances` (`a checked year of circular תשע"ב/13` g (f PLUS 0.5) p 0.6 k l)))
                                            `every subject list checked of circular תשע"ב/13`)
                                    `both booleans`)
                            `both booleans`)
                    `tenths to 1.5`)
            `both booleans`

-- F-2011-12_tashab_13-c: over every list checked, the two readings part
-- exactly for a teacher on both lists.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN l YIELD
                LET e MEANS `a checked year of circular תשע"ב/13` TRUE 1 FALSE 0 TRUE l
                IN  (NOT (`the two entitlements added` e EQUALS `the full-position technology allowance` e))
                    EQUALS (`teaches a shoes-and-coats subject` e AND `teaches a two-coats subject` e))
            `every subject list checked of circular תשע"ב/13`

-- F-2011-12_tashab_13-e: over the rates in tenths, the two readings of
-- "שיעור העסקה" part for a full-position teacher exactly where the PE share
-- is below 0.5.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN r YIELD
                (NOT (`the extra PE clothing allowance` (`a checked year of circular תשע"ב/13` TRUE 1 TRUE r FALSE EMPTY)
                      EQUALS `the extra PE clothing allowance` (`a checked year of circular תשע"ב/13` TRUE 1 TRUE 1 FALSE EMPTY)))
                EQUALS (r LESS THAN 0.5))
            `tenths to 1.5`
